{"subjectId":"api-design","id":"checklist","title":"Design checklist","group":"Security","order":25,"html":"<p class=\"lead\">Run through this before shipping any API to production. Most commonly missed requirements that cause pain in production.</p>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-route\"></i>URL &amp; resource design</h3>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Plural nouns for collections (/products not /product)</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">No verbs in URLs</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Consistent naming (snake_case or camelCase — pick one)</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Versioned with /v1, /v2</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Nested resources max 2 levels deep</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-arrows-exchange\"></i>HTTP correctness</h3>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Correct HTTP method for each operation</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Correct status codes (201 for create, 204 for delete)</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Location header on 201 Created responses</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Never 200 for errors</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-shield\"></i>Security</h3>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">All endpoints require authentication (unless explicitly public)</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Authorization checked on every request</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Rate limiting on every endpoint</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">HTTPS only — no HTTP fallback</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Input validation on every parameter</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">CORS configured correctly (not *)</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-layout-grid\"></i>Data &amp; responses</h3>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Consistent response envelope across all endpoints</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">All list endpoints have pagination</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Max page size enforced (cap at 100 or less)</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Machine-readable error codes in responses</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Request ID in all responses for debugging</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-database\"></i>Performance &amp; caching</h3>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Cache-Control headers on all GET responses</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">ETag support for conditional GETs</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Gzip compression on responses &gt; 1KB</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Rate limit headers on all responses</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-file-description\"></i>Documentation</h3>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">OpenAPI spec for all endpoints</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">All error codes documented</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Request/response examples per endpoint</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Changelog for all breaking changes</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">✓</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-desc\">Deprecation notices with Sunset header</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout callout--note\"><strong>The Stripe standard:</strong> Consistent naming, excellent docs, idempotency keys, cursor pagination, semantic versioning, and clear deprecation policy. Use it as your benchmark.</div>"}